# Copy to .env (untracked). Never put keys in .mcp.json, agent files or commits.
# Judges go through Vercel AI Gateway. Either a gateway API key, or the OIDC token
# that `vercel env pull` writes to .env.local (expires in about 12 hours; re-pull to refresh).
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
# Optional direct keys, only if we stop using the gateway:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
